notes[1]{created_at,author,text,edited_at}:
  "2026-09-28T05:51:51.824Z","harness:codex","Traceability review 2026-09-28: all 1800 tracked source/test/doc/script/package/workflow/skill artifacts in the scoped census have exact path links in at least one pm item. Path ownership alone does not prove every function, changed line or behavior is accepted. The gate should connect each changeset to canonical owners, compare declared changed paths to the actual diff, and require a documented mapping or reviewed waiver. Generated files inherit generator ownership explicitly. Use negative controls for an unlinked file, changed existing file with no item, bogus ID and terminal owner with incompatible scope.","2026-09-28T07:20:56.580Z"
